### StellarTrace example requests.
### Compatible with the VS Code "REST Client" extension and JetBrains'
### built-in HTTP client. Run `cargo run -p stellartrace-api` first.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@investigatorToken = dev-investigator-token

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Metrics
GET {{baseUrl}}/metrics

### Ingest a transaction and evaluate it against the rules engine.
# A large transfer — expect `large_transfer` (and possibly
# `new_account_high_value_outflow`) to trigger and an alert to be created.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tx_hash": "example-large-transfer",
  "ledger_sequence": 100,
  "source_account": "GALICE000000000000000000000000000000000000000000000000",
  "destination_account": "GBOB0000000000000000000000000000000000000000000000000",
  "asset": { "type": "native" },
  "amount": "50000",
  "timestamp": "2026-01-01T00:00:00Z",
  "is_soroban_invocation": false,
  "contract_id": null,
  "metadata": {}
}

### Retrieve the ingested transaction.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/transactions/example-large-transfer

### List all alerts.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/alerts

### List only open alerts.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/alerts?status=open

### Get one alert (replace :alertId with an id from the list above).
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/alerts/:alertId

### Get the AI advisory investigation for an alert. Response is always
### labeled advisory-only and can never change the alert's status.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/alerts/:alertId/ai-investigation

### Attempt a decision with no token — expect 401 Unauthorized.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/alerts/:alertId/decision
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "decision": "dismissed",
  "notes": "should be rejected: no auth"
}

### Submit the final human decision — the only thing that can change
### alert status.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/alerts/:alertId/decision
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{investigatorToken}}

{
  "decision": "confirmed_suspicious",
  "notes": "Verified with off-chain KYC records; funds traced to known mixer."
}

### Full audit trail for the alert.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/alerts/:alertId/audit

### Verify the audit chain's integrity.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/audit/verify
